[
{
"start": 15.78,
"end": 20.82,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed \u2013 built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 16,
"char_end": 91,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 20.88,
"end": 22.98,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 92,
"char_end": 113,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.98,
"end": 31.56,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we get into the details, Julien Mercier was on the show and explained that drainage is the most crucial design choice.",
"char_start": 114,
"char_end": 239,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 31.56,
"end": 32.52,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 258,
"char_end": 271,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.58,
"end": 35.1,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "And that ties in with what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 272,
"char_end": 322,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 35.1,
"end": 41.22,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point out something \u2013 Julien Mercier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 339,
"char_end": 433,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.74,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 434,
"char_end": 461,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 211.8,
"end": 215.22,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 462,
"char_end": 512,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 215.22,
"end": 221.7,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Honestly, the increased speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 531,
"char_end": 632,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 221.76,
"end": 224.76,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 633,
"char_end": 676,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 224.82,
"end": 228.42,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 677,
"char_end": 746,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 228.42,
"end": 229.56,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 763,
"char_end": 794,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 229.62,
"end": 233.04,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 795,
"char_end": 845,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 233.04,
"end": 233.58,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 864,
"char_end": 874,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 233.64,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 875,
"char_end": 971,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 240.06,
"end": 243.72,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "The setup is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 972,
"char_end": 1047,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 243.72,
"end": 244.8,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 1064,
"char_end": 1086,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 244.86,
"end": 248.28,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1087,
"char_end": 1137,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 248.28,
"end": 255.78,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1156,
"char_end": 1271,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.84,
"end": 258.78,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1272,
"char_end": 1314,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 258.84,
"end": 263.22,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "If you ignore that, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1315,
"char_end": 1401,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 263.22,
"end": 265.2,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where is it no longer working?",
"char_start": 1418,
"char_end": 1448,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 265.2,
"end": 269.46,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is particularly evident.",
"char_start": 1467,
"char_end": 1548,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 269.52,
"end": 273.84,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 1549,
"char_end": 1617,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 273.84,
"end": 277.38,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What heuristic do you consistently rely on?",
"char_start": 1634,
"char_end": 1677,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 277.44,
"end": 280.08,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1678,
"char_end": 1718,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 280.08,
"end": 281.58,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1737,
"char_end": 1757,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 281.64,
"end": 288.96,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the special stages change the choice of racing line between the reconnaissance runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 1758,
"char_end": 1890,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.14,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to delve into that further.",
"char_start": 1907,
"char_end": 1941,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.2,
"end": 844.68,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
"char_start": 1942,
"char_end": 1991,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 844.68,
"end": 847.8,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 2010,
"char_end": 2061,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 847.86,
"end": 853.56,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "The speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 2062,
"char_end": 2143,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 853.62,
"end": 856.62,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2144,
"char_end": 2187,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 856.68,
"end": 861.0,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
