"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 868.26,
"end": 875.4,
"speaker_label": "\u00c9lodie Chevalier",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor suspension adjustments.",
